requirements.txt             ← Production deps (SQLAlchemy 2.0.35, cryptography>=44, PySide6>=6.7.3)
requirements-dev.txt         ← Dev/CI deps (pytest, black, ruff, bandit)
tests/
├── test_services.py         ← 68 tests, 100% passing
└── test_workflow.py
